  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_01",
      "hash64": "A44AC6E088F76317",
      "text": "Ooohohoho!\\nOoohohohooo![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_02",
      "hash64": "A44AC7E088F764CA",
      "text": "Sieh dir das an, Billy!\\nIst das eine Pfütze?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_man_01",
      "hash64": "440A68EDEC31BD61",
      "text": "Aber nicht doch, liebste Onea...\\c\\nDas ist der größte See von ganz Paldea!\\nDer Caldero-See![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_03",
      "hash64": "A44AC8E088F7667D",
      "text": "D-Das soll ein See sein? Bist du dir sicher?\\nFür mich sieht das höchstens nach einem\\r\\nTeich aus...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_04",
      "hash64": "A44AC1E088F75A98",
      "text": "Sag mal... Wo liegt eigentlich der Unterschied\\nzwischen einem See und einem Teich?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_man_02",
      "hash64": "440A65EDEC31B848",
      "text": "Das weiß ich leider auch nicht...\\c\\nIch glaube, die Wertvorstellungen von uns VIPs\\nunterscheiden sich einfach zu sehr von denen\\r\\ngewöhnlicher Leute, um so was zu beurteilen...[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 178,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_05",
      "hash64": "A44AC2E088F75C4B",
      "text": "Nanu? Da ist Du-weißt-schon-wer wieder![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_man_03",
      "hash64": "440A66EDEC31B9FB",
      "text": "Oh, du hast recht. Das ist zweifelsohne [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0605,0000)]unserunsere\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,1312,0000)]liebster Vertreterliebste Vertreterin des kleinen Mannes![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0605",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "1312",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_06",
      "hash64": "A44AC3E088F75DFE",
      "text": "Du kommst sehr gelegen, vielleicht kannst du mir\\nja eine Frage beantworten...\\c\\nWas ist der Unterschied zwischen einem See\\nund einem Teich?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_select_01",
      "hash64": "C8C1F5BDFADE575F",
      "text": "Die Größe?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_select_02",
      "hash64": "C8C1F6BDFADE5912",
      "text": "Die Tiefe?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_07",
      "hash64": "A44AC4E088F75FB1",
      "text": "Aber ja, verstehe! Es wundert mich nicht,\\ndass ein Mitglied des Pöbels über diese Art\\r\\nvon Allgemeinwissen verfügt.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_08",
      "hash64": "A44ABDE088F753CC",
      "text": "Als VIP ist es meine Pflicht, mich für diese\\nAuskunft bei dir zu revanchieren.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_09",
      "hash64": "A44ABEE088F7557F",
      "text": "In diesem Sinne: Das hier ist für dich.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_10",
      "hash64": "A44E4BE088FA7AED",
      "text": "Und lass mich noch ein bisschen meiner Weisheit\\nmit dir teilen...\\c\\nGlück ist wie Wasser.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_11",
      "hash64": "A44E4AE088FA793A",
      "text": "Ob es eine Pfütze, ein Teich oder ein See ist,\\nkommt nur auf die Perspektive an![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_man_04",
      "hash64": "440A6BEDEC31C27A",
      "text": "Du bist einfach unglaublich, meine liebe Onea!\\c\\nGerade eben noch hat [VAR 0x1100(00FF,1412,0000)]der arme Schluckerdie arme Schluckerin dir\\netwas beigebracht, und prompt haust du [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0708,0000)]ihm seinihr ihr\\r\\neigenes Wissen um die Ohren![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "1412",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 159,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0708",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 180,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 212,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_12",
      "hash64": "A44E49E088FA7787",
      "text": "Weiter geht’s, Billy!\\c\\nAls Nächstes möchte ich einen [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Berg[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] sehen,\\nder so hoch ist wie der Profit unserer Firma.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_man_05",
      "hash64": "440A6CEDEC31C42D",
      "text": "Uh, là, là! Bei einer Vorzeige-Jetsetterin wie dir\\ndürfte es niemanden wundern, dass der Gewinn\\r\\ndeiner Firma höher als jeder Berg ist![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_man_06",
      "hash64": "440A69EDEC31BF14",
      "text": "Komm, lass uns auf einem verschneiten Berg\\nEis-Pokémon beobachten und Eiscreme genießen![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_secretary_01",
      "hash64": "B961E550E6A71A4B",
      "text": "Señora Onea und Señor Billy sehen sich gerade\\nein großes Gewässer in Paldea an.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_secretary_02",
      "hash64": "B961E650E6A71BFE",
      "text": "Aber was meinen sie nur damit? Einen Fluss?\\nEinen Teich? Vielleicht einen See?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
